---
import SimplePage from '../../components/SimplePage.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<SimplePage lang="en" route="privacy" title="Privacy Policy">
  <p>
    Protecting your personal data is important to me. This page explains what information may be processed when you
    visit this website or contact Forma Studio and how that information is used.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible party</h2>
  <p>
    Forma Studio<br />
    Switzerland<br />
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>If you have any questions about data protection, you can email Forma Studio at any time.</p>

  <h2>Contacting Forma Studio</h2>
  <p>
    When you contact Forma Studio through the contact form or by email, the information you provide is processed in
    order to answer your inquiry and prepare a possible collaboration.
  </p>
  <p>
    The contact form can be used to send, in particular, your name, email address, business, the service you are
    interested in, your budget range and information about your project. Some of these details are optional.
  </p>
  <p>
    Inquiries are kept only for as long as needed to handle them or for any business relationship that results. Legal
    retention requirements remain reserved.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and technical data</h2>
  <p>
    This website is delivered through Netlify. When you visit the website, technically necessary data may be processed,
    such as your IP address, the time of access, the page requested and information about your browser and operating
    system. This processing keeps the website running securely and reliably.
  </p>
  <p>
    The contact form is also processed through Netlify and form submissions are stored there. To protect against spam,
    Netlify uses the Akismet spam-filtering service.
  </p>
  <p>Email inquiries and notifications about form submissions may be processed through the Forma Studio Gmail inbox.</p>
  <p>
    Because Netlify and Google are international providers based in the USA, data may also be processed outside
    Switzerland.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Forma Studio currently uses no analytics or tracking services and does not itself set any cookies for analytics or
    advertising purposes. Fonts and images are served directly by this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Sharing of data</h2>
  <p>
    Personal data is not sold or used for third-party advertising. It is shared with service providers only as far as
    needed to operate the website and handle inquiries.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Within the scope of applicable data protection law, you can in particular request information about the personal
    data stored about you and ask for it to be corrected or deleted. Consent you have given can be withdrawn under the
    conditions set out by law.
  </p>
  <p>
    To do so, simply write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You may also contact the Swiss Federal
    Data Protection and Information Commissioner (FDPIC).
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>This privacy policy may be updated if the website or the services used change.</p>
  <p>Last updated: October 2026</p>
</SimplePage>
